 r←MakeRelease publish;assets;cfg;cider;dist;file;from;home;nuget_config;parms;to;v;version
⍝ Make a new release of ParquetDotNet
 home←CiderConfig.HOME
 cider←CiderConfig.CIDER

⍝ Copy version from package config
 version←⎕VR'Version'
 v←1⎕JSON Version ⋄ ⎕FX'cfg←.*' 'r←cfg.version'⎕R''v⊢version
 {}⎕SE.Link.Add'Version'

⍝ Create distribution and assets folders if not exists
 dist←cider.distributionFolder
 1 ⎕MKDIR dist
 cfg←⎕SE.Tatin.ReadPackageConfigFile home
 assets←home,'/',cfg.assets
 1 ⎕MKDIR assets

⍝ Copy .NET project config to assets
 nuget_config←'_nuget-dependencies.csproj'
 from←home,'/',cider.dependencies.nuget,'/',nuget_config
 to←assets,'/',nuget_config
 to(⎕NCOPY ⎕OPT'IfExists' 'Replace')from
⍝ Build package
 parms←⎕SE.Tatin.CreateBuildParms CiderConfig.HOME
 parms.targetPath←dist
 file←⎕SE.Tatin.BuildPackage parms

⍝ Publish to tatin server
 :If publish
     r←⎕SE.Tatin.PublishPackage file'[tatin-test]'
 :Else
     r←'Package built to ',file
 :EndIf

⍝ Restore dynamic Version function
 ⎕FX version ⋄ {}⎕SE.Link.Add'Version'
